[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0009","text":"小妹妹"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0010","text":"“我也，要像你们一样……\n　将力量…………”"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0019","text":"导演"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0020","text":"——这里，每次都会卡住呢\n是不是太紧张了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0029","text":"小妹妹"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0030","text":"对不起……\n可能，确实是这样……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0039","text":"导演"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0040","text":"台词也确实比较长，很难呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0050","text":"嗯，实在不行的话\n就让L'Antica的各位来承接这段心情吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0059","text":"小妹妹"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0060","text":"！\n……我……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0069","text":"导演"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0070","text":"那样的话，你就在后面静静看着就好\n幽谷，这样可以吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0080","text":"好的……我……\n但是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0090","text":"——嗯……\n慰问品的曲奇真好吃"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0092","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0100","text":"……要不要吃一点？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0109","text":"小妹妹"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0110","text":"…………嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0111","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0120","text":"你还好吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0129","text":"小妹妹"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0130","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0140","text":"……看来遇到了些困难呢\n能跟我聊聊吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0149","text":"小妹妹"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0150","text":"……台词，我都记住了\n但总觉得这个角色的心情，这样真的对吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0160","text":"一想到这个，话就说不出来了\n然后就…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0170","text":"……距离正式演出还有时间\n我们慢慢把感觉找好，让它变得更好吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0172","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0180","text":"……而且，你不是要找个榜样嘛\n——恋钟就是啊————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0189","text":"工作人员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0190","text":"月冈小姐，站位在这边！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0191","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0200","text":"——抱歉～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0201","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0210","text":"请让我再来一次！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0211","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0219","text":"小妹妹"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0220","text":"────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0221","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020300_02_0230","text":"……那就是宇宙第一的秘诀之一哦\n好好看着吧—"}]
